格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Notion connector for DeepSeek Harness: agent tools + Web settings page · DSH 的 Notion 连接插件","id":"gh:1335712954","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-notion-connector","slug":"zhengjy01/dsh-notion-connector","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Notion connector for DeepSeek Harness: agent tools + Web settings page · DSH 的 Notion 连接插件"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-notion-connector"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> **English** | **中文**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A Notion connector plugin for DeepSeek Harness. Configure an Integration Token once, and both the ag"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ent and the Web GUI settings page can operate your Notion workspace."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Agent tools** (available automatically after configuration):\n- `notion_search` — search pages/da"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"tabases\n- `notion_read_page` — read page title, properties, and content blocks (nested blocks are re"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ad recursively, up to 200 blocks)\n- `notion_query_database` — query database entries (filter / sorts"},{"id":"p6s4","text":" / pagination)\n- `notion_create_page` — create a page (under a page or a database)\n- `notion_update_"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"page` — update properties / archive\n- `notion_append_blocks` — append content blocks\n- **Web setting"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"s page**: Settings → Notion — connection status, Token input (automatically validated and the worksp"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"ace name is read on save), clear configuration, three-step guide\n- **Storage**: the Token is stored "},{"id":"p6s8","text":"in `~/.dsh/notion.json` (permissions 0600); the browser interacts with the plugin through the loopba"},{"id":"p6s9","text":"ck-only `/api/dsh-notion-connector/*` endpoints; API calls use Node's native fetch, with no shell de"},{"id":"p6s10","text":"`/api/dsh-notion-connector/*` endpoints; API calls use Node's native fetch, with no shell dependency"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Restart dsh web to activate the plugin."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"1. Open <https://www.notion.so/my-integrations> and create an internal integration; copy the Interna"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"l Integration Secret (starts with `secret_`)\n2. In Notion, **Share** the pages/databases you want to"},{"id":"p11s3","text":" access with the integration\n3. In the GUI, go to Settings → Notion, paste the Token and save\n4. Aft"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"er that, just tell the agent things like \"search for XX in Notion\" or \"save this content to Notion\""},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Limitations"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- Pages/databases must be shared with the integration before they can be accessed\n- The Token is sto"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"red in plaintext in a private file in your home directory (permissions 0600)\n- This plugin is third-"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"party code: review the source before installing, and only use it from trusted sources"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
